  data: {
    LLM: "As the player who knows the trump, use your first play to signal clearly to your partner. If you lead a trump, your partner will likely identify the suit immediately.\n\nDeduction: If your partner (who knows trumps) plays a card and the dealer is forced to follow with a trump, you now know the trump suit. Use this knowledge to support the next lead.\n\nThe False Signal: Occasionally play a non-trump high card to see if opponents take the bait and assume it's trumps, potentially leading them to waste their own high cards.",
    Player: "As the player who knows the trump, use your first play to signal clearly to your partner. If you lead a trump, your partner will likely identify the suit immediately.\n\nDeduction: If your partner (who knows trumps) plays a card and the dealer is forced to follow with a trump, you now know the trump suit. Use this knowledge to support the next lead.\n\nThe False Signal: Occasionally play a non-trump high card to see if opponents take the bait and assume it's trumps, potentially leading them to waste their own high cards.",
